graph TD
    A[Error Occurs] --> B{Error Level?}

    B -->|Component| C[Feature Error Boundary]
    B -->|Feature| C
    B -->|App| D[Global Error Boundary]

    C --> E{Retry Count?}
    E -->|< 3| F[Auto Retry with Backoff]
    E -->|>= 3| G[Show Manual Retry UI]

    F --> H{Success?}
    H -->|Yes| I[Resume Normal Operation]
    H -->|No| E

    G --> J{User Action?}
    J -->|Retry| K[Reset State & Retry]
    J -->|Go Home| L[Navigate to Home]
    J -->|Continue| M[Use Rest of App]

    K --> H

    D --> N[Show Critical Error UI]
    N --> O{User Action?}
    O -->|Reload Page| P[Full Page Refresh]
    O -->|Go Home| L

    I --> Q[Normal App State]
    L --> Q
    M --> Q
    P --> Q

    style C fill:#ffd43b,stroke:#fab005
    style D fill:#ff6b6b,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#fff
    style I fill:#51cf66,stroke:#2f9e44
    style Q fill:#51cf66,stroke:#2f9e44
